" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tSHPR"><span style="padding-left: 11.01pt;">42</span></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 504pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tANRE">Annual Report</a></div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 21.01pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tANRE"><span style="padding-left: 11.01pt;">43</span></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 504pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tOTMA">Other Matters</a></div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 21.01pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tOTMA"><span style="padding-left: 11.01pt;">44</span></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 504pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tNICM">Non-Incorporation of Certain Matters</a></div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 21.01pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tNICM"><span style="padding-left: 11.01pt;">45</span></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 504pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tEXOS">Expenses of Solicitation</a></div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 21.01pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tEXOS"><span style="padding-left: 11.01pt;">46</span></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 504pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tHOPM">Householding of Proxy Materials</a></div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 21.01pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; padding-bottom: 6.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tHOPM"><span style="padding-left: 11.01pt;">47</span></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 504pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tEXA">Exhibit A &#8212; Amendment to the 2025 Equity Compensation Plan</a></div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 21.01pt; padding-top: 6.24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tEXA"><span style="padding-left: 11.01pt;">48</span></a></div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 3pt; width: 504pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3pt; width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3pt; width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3pt; width: 21.01pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div></div><div>
