ned does not constitute an admission of beneficial ownership. </div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 522pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 9pt; text-align: center;">MediaCo Holding Inc.&#8195;&#8195;13&#8195;&#8195;<span style="font-weight: normal;">2026 Proxy Statement</span><br/></div></div></div><div>
