-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 30.72pt; padding-top: 4.4pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: middle; background-color: #EDEDED; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 22.72pt; text-align: left;">&#8212;</div></td><td style="width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 30.72pt; padding-top: 4.4pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: middle; background-color: #EDEDED; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 22.72pt; text-align: left;">&#8212;</div></td><td style="width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 56.64pt; padding-top: 4.4pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: middle; background-color: #EDEDED; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 48.63pt; text-align: left;">&#8212;</div></td><td style="width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 28.9pt; padding-top: 4.4pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: middle; background-color: #EDEDED; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><span style="padding-left: 20.9pt;">&#8212;</span></div></td><td style="width: 4pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 6pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 120pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 62.21pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 30.72pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 30.72pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 56.64pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 18.28pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 28.9pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 4pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 522pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 9pt; text-align: center;">MediaCo Holding Inc.&#8195;&#8195;19&#8195;&#8195;<span style="font-weight: normal;">2026 Proxy Statement</span><br/></div></div></div><div>
