7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">(b)</div></td><td style="width: 4.58pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.58pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 121.29pt; padding-bottom: 2.88pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">Number of securities <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">remaining available for <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">future issuance under equity <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">compensation plans <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">(excluding securities <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">reflected in column (a)) <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">(c) </div></td><td style="width: 4pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 6pt; b