le="width: 36.14pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 51.71pt; padding-bottom: 2.88pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">Year ended <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">December&#160;31, <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">2025 </div></td><td style="width: 4pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 6pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 264pt; padding-top: 2.65pt; padding-bottom: 3.63pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: middle; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #2FABDE; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 3pt; text-align: left;">Audit Fees<sup>(1)</sup></div></td><td style="width: 36.14pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 36.14pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 51.71pt; padding-top: 2.65pt; padding-bottom: 3.63pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: middle; background-color: #EDEDED; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 11.69pt; text-align: left;">$<span style="padding-left: 6.67pt;">704,250</span></div></td><td style="width: 36.14pt; background-color: #EDEDED;"><div style="font-s